WEBVTT

00:00:02.830 --> 00:00:04.480
Welcome!

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.480
Table for one?

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:12.990
Last night, Haru suddenly said…

00:00:14.210 --> 00:00:18.100
Bring that girl who calls herself your fiancée to work tomorrow.

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:26.460
I wanted to see Shizuka in
a Plavi uniform for the first time.

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:31.840
Come now, Brother,
you’re letting your mind wander.

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:35.840
Are you falling in love with her
all over again?

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:38.350
Shut up.

00:00:39.290 --> 00:00:44.350
When I looked at Shizuka,
I could see what they saw in her…

00:00:44.350 --> 00:00:47.010
…for the first and last time.

00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:52.380
By this time two days from now,
she will already be…

00:01:00.850 --> 00:01:02.020
What’s the matter?

00:01:02.020 --> 00:01:03.520
You’re spacing out.

00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:05.710
Aha. Since both Emi-rin and Shizuka-chan

00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:07.900
had to stay behind because it’s
their turn to clean the classroom,

00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:08.960
you’re lonely, right?

00:01:09.930 --> 00:01:10.970
That’s ridiculous!

00:01:11.490 --> 00:01:14.740
Well, Ryo, bye-bye.

00:01:14.740 --> 00:01:16.340
See you tomorrow.

00:01:16.340 --> 00:01:18.210
Yeah, see ya.

00:01:24.210 --> 00:01:28.650
We didn’t let anyone except Haru know that Shizuka will be leaving soon.

00:01:29.340 --> 00:01:31.670
We did nothing special.

00:01:31.670 --> 00:01:34.300
Now a week has passed,

00:01:34.300 --> 00:01:37.020
and the promised day has arrived.

00:01:46.380 --> 00:01:51.590
So I don’t spill my wish from my eyes,

00:01:52.430 --> 00:01:58.460
I want to make my heart race to you.

00:01:59.770 --> 00:02:05.820
I put my feelings on this palette of endearment

00:02:05.820 --> 00:02:11.450
and paint them on my heart.

00:02:12.360 --> 00:02:14.410
The sweetness

00:02:15.490 --> 00:02:19.450
and the strength you gave are sitting back to back.

00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:20.910
The time

00:02:22.670 --> 00:02:27.340
is drawing bells in the sky.

00:02:28.940 --> 00:02:35.470
Colorful assortments of balloons of dreams

00:02:35.470 --> 00:02:37.360
float in the wind,

00:02:37.360 --> 00:02:39.240
flowing toward you,

00:02:39.240 --> 00:02:42.710
freely.

00:02:42.710 --> 00:02:49.520
I’m happy that I found destiny.

00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:53.150
It’s filling with colors.

00:02:53.150 --> 00:02:58.160
The Hina Dolls of
Love and Farewell
The Great End!?

00:03:04.940 --> 00:03:06.740
Ugh, Akane…

00:03:07.480 --> 00:03:08.610
To my brother:

00:03:08.610 --> 00:03:11.110
I’m working at Plavi as an extra helper.

00:03:11.110 --> 00:03:13.950
This is Shizuka-chan’s favorite dessert, apple pie.

00:03:13.950 --> 00:03:16.940
Please eat this with her like good, old friends. Promise me, OK?

00:03:16.940 --> 00:03:17.760
Akane.

00:03:19.450 --> 00:03:22.760
We said we’d do nothing special.

00:03:26.070 --> 00:03:28.770
My, my, it’s already this late.

00:03:29.550 --> 00:03:31.070
Well, Shizuka, I’ll see you tomorrow.

00:03:31.800 --> 00:03:32.760
Yes.

00:03:32.760 --> 00:03:34.870
Take care of yourself, Emiho-sama.

00:03:52.830 --> 00:04:05.740
See you tomorrow…

00:04:13.380 --> 00:04:15.920
I’m home, Ryo-sama.

00:04:15.920 --> 00:04:17.090
Hey, welcome home.

00:04:17.090 --> 00:04:18.970
I’ve been waiting for you.

00:04:18.970 --> 00:04:20.480
This smell…

00:04:21.640 --> 00:04:27.650
This is the smell of my favorite dessert and drink, apple pie and milk tea!

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:33.380
Ryo-sama, this is…!!!

00:04:34.150 --> 00:04:36.080
Akane got it for us.

00:04:36.820 --> 00:04:39.610
The tea isn’t ready yet,
so give me a second.

00:04:39.610 --> 00:04:41.090
Sure!

00:04:45.660 --> 00:04:47.750
It’s so romantic.

00:04:47.750 --> 00:04:49.350
Romantic, huh?

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:51.380
I’m so happy.

00:04:51.380 --> 00:04:56.130
We rarely had any moments to ourselves.

00:04:56.130 --> 00:04:57.640
Have you noticed?

00:04:58.550 --> 00:05:00.370
Is that right?

00:05:00.370 --> 00:05:01.860
Well, why don’t you eat?

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:03.520
Yes!

00:05:03.520 --> 00:05:04.700
Ah~n.

00:05:05.600 --> 00:05:07.200
Ah~n, huh?

00:05:12.020 --> 00:05:13.160
Here.

00:05:15.440 --> 00:05:17.820
The apple pie that
Ryo-sama is feeding me

00:05:17.820 --> 00:05:19.340
tastes so special!

00:05:24.650 --> 00:05:26.140
Oh, yes!

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:30.640
It’s a nice occasion, so why don’t you join the party too?

00:05:31.750 --> 00:05:32.890
What are they?

00:05:33.630 --> 00:05:35.380
Do you not know what they are?

00:05:35.380 --> 00:05:36.900
They are hina dolls.

00:05:37.340 --> 00:05:39.400
Oh, it’s already time for Hinamatsuri.

00:05:39.800 --> 00:05:40.880
Yes!

00:05:40.880 --> 00:05:42.760
This is Ryo-sama,

00:05:42.760 --> 00:05:44.530
and this is me.

00:05:45.010 --> 00:05:47.520
Why you…

00:05:55.230 --> 00:05:56.460
Once upon a time,

00:05:58.650 --> 00:06:00.950
the heir of a prestigious family

00:06:02.110 --> 00:06:06.710
had an unselfish, but passionate love for a girl.

00:06:08.580 --> 00:06:12.400
However, the girl happened to be from the lower class.

00:06:12.400 --> 00:06:14.290
Thus, the two were separated to preserve the reputation

00:06:14.290 --> 00:06:16.590
and social status of the
prestigious family.

00:06:17.620 --> 00:06:19.480
What’s this about?

00:06:21.010 --> 00:06:22.150
Eventually,

00:06:22.150 --> 00:06:26.090
the heir got married to the woman that his family recommended,

00:06:26.090 --> 00:06:28.160
even though he was partially depressed about it.

00:06:28.560 --> 00:06:31.630
Thankfully, his new wife possessed an amicable personality,

00:06:31.630 --> 00:06:37.100
and so in time, the heir was able to forget about his first love.

00:06:37.100 --> 00:06:40.280
He told me that even he himself believed so until just recently.

00:06:40.280 --> 00:06:41.880
He did?

00:06:42.360 --> 00:06:46.490
Two years ago, he lost his wife.

00:06:46.490 --> 00:06:49.890
And then he started
remembering that girl again.

00:06:50.830 --> 00:06:53.420
He could no longer deny his feelings,
so he did some research and found out…

00:06:53.420 --> 00:06:55.890
that she had already passed away.

00:06:56.960 --> 00:06:59.800
However, she had two grandchildren,

00:06:59.800 --> 00:07:04.950
both of whom happened to be very close in age to his own granddaughter.

00:07:08.680 --> 00:07:11.040
And those two are Akane and I?

00:07:19.230 --> 00:07:22.790
You may think that this is
trivial and ridiculous.

00:07:23.650 --> 00:07:26.110
If even only for a little while,

00:07:26.110 --> 00:07:30.830
he wanted his lost love to be realized through a relationship between you and me.

00:07:30.830 --> 00:07:33.800
It seems that was his wish.

00:07:34.870 --> 00:07:36.320
I see.

00:07:37.500 --> 00:07:40.040
Why were you hiding this from me?

00:07:40.040 --> 00:07:40.820
Because…

00:07:41.880 --> 00:07:46.090
Because if I told you, you might have thought that I was trying to manipulate you with pity.

00:07:46.090 --> 00:07:48.820
I would not have been happy.

00:07:52.310 --> 00:07:53.420
Weren’t you…

00:07:53.420 --> 00:07:55.230
Weren’t you unhappy with that?

00:07:55.230 --> 00:07:57.410
I know you did it for your favorite grandfather…

00:07:58.310 --> 00:07:59.190
Yes.

00:07:59.190 --> 00:08:01.320
Yes, I was unhappy at first.

00:08:02.280 --> 00:08:05.300
I didn’t know what kind of person Ryo-sama was.

00:08:06.150 --> 00:08:06.970
But now…

00:08:11.910 --> 00:08:16.840
But now, I don’t care if it is because of pity.

00:08:18.000 --> 00:08:19.220
That’s how I feel.

00:08:20.130 --> 00:08:22.430
I don’t care if it is because of pity.

00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:28.690
It’s better than not being able to see each other ever again.

00:08:30.010 --> 00:08:31.990
Shizuka, but I…

00:08:31.990 --> 00:08:33.270
It’s okay!

00:08:33.270 --> 00:08:34.770
I know.

00:08:35.310 --> 00:08:39.120
I know that you will still live
according to your own beliefs.

00:08:52.830 --> 00:08:55.760
So at least take these,

00:08:56.410 --> 00:08:59.380
as a token that we have met.

00:09:02.130 --> 00:09:03.270
These…

00:09:03.270 --> 00:09:05.460
Don’t worry.

00:09:05.460 --> 00:09:10.240
They’ll expire when you meet a nice girl.

00:09:11.140 --> 00:09:12.640
A good luck charm for matchmaking, huh?

00:09:12.640 --> 00:09:13.440
No.

00:09:14.430 --> 00:09:16.220
They are cursed

00:09:16.220 --> 00:09:18.560
so that you won’t be able
to find anyone else.

00:09:18.560 --> 00:09:23.070
Then, you might come back
to me someday.

00:09:23.940 --> 00:09:26.750
I wonder if they will expire soon.

00:09:27.100 --> 00:09:28.210
But I…

00:09:36.950 --> 00:09:40.550
I want them to last as long as possible.

00:09:48.880 --> 00:09:50.060
There is…

00:09:50.760 --> 00:09:53.390
There is nothing I’m hiding from you anymore.

00:09:54.390 --> 00:09:56.010
The rest is…

00:09:56.010 --> 00:09:59.060
My birthday is March fifth;
my blood type is A.

00:09:59.060 --> 00:10:01.780
For fun, I enjoy watching movies.

00:10:02.560 --> 00:10:07.910
My future dream is to have a warm family.

00:10:08.690 --> 00:10:10.830
As for my preferences in men,

00:10:11.490 --> 00:10:12.630
They are…

00:10:14.120 --> 00:10:17.000
And, and…

00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:18.130
That’s enough.

00:10:18.700 --> 00:10:22.140
Then what do I need to do?

00:10:23.250 --> 00:10:25.340
How can I make you say it?

00:10:25.770 --> 00:10:26.650
What?

00:10:27.800 --> 00:10:29.270
That this is not the end!

00:10:29.920 --> 00:10:31.300
Please tell me.

00:10:31.300 --> 00:10:32.770
What will happen now?

00:10:33.260 --> 00:10:36.010
I know I’ve caused you a lot of trouble.

00:10:36.010 --> 00:10:37.600
I know I’ve acted out of line.

00:10:37.600 --> 00:10:39.680
I will apologize for that
as much as you wish!

00:10:39.680 --> 00:10:40.520
So, please!

00:10:40.520 --> 00:10:42.160
I don’t care about…

00:10:42.160 --> 00:10:46.110
I’m sorry!

00:10:46.110 --> 00:10:47.230
That’s enough.

00:10:47.230 --> 00:10:49.290
I’m not upset about it anymore.

00:10:49.900 --> 00:10:51.320
Then…

00:10:51.320 --> 00:10:53.710
Then what am I missing?

00:10:54.240 --> 00:10:57.790
There is nothing wrong with you.

00:10:57.790 --> 00:10:58.560
You know it.

00:10:58.560 --> 00:11:01.060
I don’t get it!

00:11:05.250 --> 00:11:09.210
Did that first encounter really bother you that much?

00:11:09.210 --> 00:11:12.340
You hate political power that much?

00:11:12.340 --> 00:11:17.730
Does saying “don’t go” really violate your beliefs that much?

00:11:18.350 --> 00:11:19.510
That’s not it.

00:11:19.510 --> 00:11:20.470
This is…

00:11:20.470 --> 00:11:22.660
What’s best for me, right?

00:11:22.660 --> 00:11:25.270
But what about you?

00:11:25.270 --> 00:11:27.310
Aren’t you lonely?

00:11:27.310 --> 00:11:28.230
Well…

00:11:28.230 --> 00:11:31.550
Do you hate me that much?

00:11:31.550 --> 00:11:32.570
No!

00:11:32.570 --> 00:11:34.830
Then why?!

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:46.820
I want to stay by your side.

00:11:46.820 --> 00:11:52.440
My heart sways in the wind.

00:11:53.540 --> 00:11:58.850
This stillness

00:11:58.850 --> 00:12:04.620
burns in my heart.

00:12:05.480 --> 00:12:07.150
Is the bouquet
of distant memories

00:12:07.150 --> 00:12:07.710
Sorry.

00:12:07.710 --> 00:12:10.790
Is the bouquet
of distant memories

00:12:10.790 --> 00:12:17.050
blossoming somewhere now?

00:12:17.480 --> 00:12:23.600
Even if we grow apart,

00:12:23.600 --> 00:12:27.730
we can meet again, right?

00:12:27.960 --> 00:12:29.860
Ryo-sama, you stupid, stubborn, bigot!

00:12:29.860 --> 00:12:32.130
I want you to hold me

00:12:32.130 --> 00:12:32.810
Shizuka!
I want you to hold me

00:12:32.810 --> 00:12:36.000
I want you to hold me

00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:39.620
so I don’t freeze.

00:12:41.480 --> 00:12:47.630
The teary tiara.

00:12:47.630 --> 00:12:52.080
The unchanging wish.

00:12:52.990 --> 00:12:56.580
I hate you…

00:12:59.120 --> 00:13:01.290
I hate you!

00:13:02.370 --> 00:13:03.180
Shizuka!

00:13:16.470 --> 00:13:19.510
The moment came

00:13:20.350 --> 00:13:23.510
very much out of the blue.

00:13:24.750 --> 00:13:28.650
You showed up right in front of me,

00:13:28.650 --> 00:13:31.370
then started to change everything.

00:13:32.380 --> 00:13:35.200
If my meeting you

00:13:36.100 --> 00:13:39.050
is not by fate,

00:13:40.400 --> 00:13:44.410
there are no miracles,

00:13:44.410 --> 00:13:49.600
even if I search all over the world.

00:13:49.800 --> 00:13:52.990
Embracing love,

00:13:53.800 --> 00:13:56.920
kissing love,

00:13:57.670 --> 00:14:00.850
holding love,

00:14:01.350 --> 00:14:05.190
I whisper, “I love you.”

00:14:05.190 --> 00:14:09.180
Please look at me and me alone,

00:14:09.180 --> 00:14:12.600
forever.
